[{"id":178850948,"discussion_id":"2a93afdd36ef2d0fbc9b3064bc1de08e9100a78b","body":"#### 变更摘要\n\n此 PR 针对 CeluV2 算子在 NPU 上的精度问题，重写了负分支的 expm1 计算逻辑，采用 Kahan 恒等式配合 `|u|` 双重 guard 实现数值稳定，解决了 v1 版本在小 alpha 场景下 `exp(u)` 溢出导致 NaN/-0 污染正分支结果的问题。同时将 `Compute` 函数拆分为多个语义清晰的子阶段，并将 tiling 侧的 UB 逻辑缓冲数以具名常量替代魔法数字。\n\n**主要改动**\n\n- **负分支 expm1 数值稳定性修复**：在 `ComputeExpm1NegBranch` 中实现双重 guard 策略——当 `|u| < 0.5` 时使用 Kahan 恒等式 `u*(e-1)/ln(e)` 避免灾难性抵消，当 `|u| >= 0.5` 时回退到朴素 `e-1` 避免溢出/下溢导致的 NaN/-0；内层 guard 进一步处理 `|u|` 极小（`e==1`）时 Kahan 表达式 `0/0=NaN` 的边界情况，此时直接用 `u` 替代。\n- **Compute 函数拆分为可读子阶段**：将原 `Compute` 内联逻辑拆分为 `CastToFloat`、`ComputeExpm1NegBranch`、`CombineBranches`、`CastToOutput` 四个独立子函数，保持指令流和 `PipeBarrier` 语义不变，仅提升代码可读性。\n- **UB 临时缓冲区扩展**：`tmpBuffer` 从 2 个增至 5 个（`tmpBuffer3`/`4`/`5`），以容纳 Kahan 计算所需的 `u`、`e`、`ln(e)`、Kahan 结果、朴素 expm1 五个并存的 fp32 临时张量。\n- **Tiling 侧 UB 缓冲数以具名常量表达**：新增 `HALF_PRECISION_MAX_BYTES`、`UB_LOGICAL_BUFFER_NUM_HALF`、`UB_LOGICAL_BUFFER_NUM_FP32` 三个常量，半精度路径缓冲数从 4 调整为 7，fp32 路径从 3 调整为 5，消除原有魔法数字。\n\n","created_at":"2026-07-07T11:01:13+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-07T11:33:13+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":178850951,"discussion_id":"be7ac67d6eb8fc75ba806359fedb31e538e35285","body":"#### 代码审查\n\n经过对两个变更文件的彻底审查（包括逐行分析、UB预算数学验证、PipeBarrier正确性检查、数值算法边界情况的详细分析），没有发现此 diff 引入的任何正确性、安全、可靠性或性能回归问题。\n\n## 各文件审查确认\n\n- **`activation/celu_v2/op_host/arch35/celu_v2_tiling_arch35.cpp`**：✅ 无问题。将逻辑缓冲区常量从 4/3 更新为 7/5，正确地考虑了 kernel 中新增的 3 个临时缓冲区；tiling UB 预算数学已验证在半精度和 fp32 两种精度下均安全。\n- **`activation/celu_v2/op_kernel/arch35/celu_v2.h`**：✅ 无问题。Kahan 恒等式 expm1 实现及其内部（微小 |u|）和外部（|u| < 0.5）双重 guard 逻辑经过算法级审查，在所有边界条件下均正确；PipeBarrier 放置和临时缓冲区复用已逐条验证；子函数拆分不引入流水线风险。\n\n## 总结\n\n- P0–P3 问题：0 个\n- 整体风险判断：低。此变更是对负分支的完整数值精度修复，消除了 v1 在小 alpha 尾部 NaN/-0 污染正分支的问题。UB 预算已重新校准以容纳额外的临时缓冲区。\n\n| 类型 | 数量 |\n|------|-------|\n| \uD83D\uDD34 阻塞 | 0 |\n| \uD83D\uDFE1 建议 | 1 |\n\n\uD83D\uDCAC 仅评论\n\n","created_at":"2026-07-07T11:01:14+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-07T12:20:29+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":178850992,"discussion_id":"01f657a29c738bc79b16fd17dcadb3aabf31db09","body":"Thanks for your pull-request.\nThe full list of commands accepted by me can be found at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/robot/robot%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md#-%E5%A6%82%E9%9C%80%E4%BA%86%E8%A7%A3%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E7%9A%84%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83%E4%B8%8B%E6%96%B9%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC)。\nYou can get sig-info at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/community/blob/master/CANN/sigs/ops-nn/sig-info.yaml)\n\n\n---\n\n## PR Approval Progress\n\n✅ **Congratulations! All modules have met the lgtm and approve requirements.**\n\n### Module Approval Details\n\n| module | lgtm status | approve status |\n|------|-----------|--------------|\n| activation | ✅ [*陈琦*](https://gitcode.com/chenqi317), [*王星*](https://gitcode.com/wang-xing001) (2/2) | ✅ [*陈琦*](https://gitcode.com/chenqi317), [*王星*](https://gitcode.com/wang-xing001) (2/1) |\n\n> \uD83D\uDCA1 Tip:\n> - **Committer** can comment `/approve` or `/lgtm`\n> - Commenting `/approve` implies both code review (lgtm) and intent to merge (approve)\n\n------\n\n## CLA Signature Pass  \n gcw_YBIAEfqJ, thanks for your pull request. All authors of the commits have signed the CLA. :+1:","created_at":"2026-07-07T11:01:21+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-07T16:03:45+0