9 行新增 `CompareScalar(…, this->tileDataNum)`。\n2. 该仓库中所有其他使用 `CompareScalar` 的 arch35 kernel 均将 count 对齐到 256 字节边界：\n   - `heaviside.h`：同样做了对齐\n3. 当 `tileDataNum` 不是 64 的整数倍时，`CompareScalar` 会内部向上取整到 256 字节边界，从而**读取超出 `tmpBuffer3` 分配范围**的 UB 内存（相邻 buffer 的数据），导致：\n   - 尾部 mask 位基于脏数据（相邻 buffer 的随机值），虽然 `Select` 只取前 `tileDataNum` 个元素，但源端越界读取是 UB（Undefined Behavior）\n\n**触发条件：** `tileDataNum % 64 ≠ 0`（几乎所有实际 tile 尺寸均不满足 — 例如 256KB UB fp32 时 `tileDataNum = 6552`，`6552 % 64 = 24`）。","created_at":"2026-07-07T12:20:30+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-07T16:08:29+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"diff_comment","resolved":true,"resolved_by":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"diff_position":{"start_new_line":170,"end_new_line":170,"position_type":"text"}},{"id":178908262,"discussion_id":"e277a1af2b06c7868dbb6da807bfa023853302a7","body":"/lgtm\n/approve","created_at":"2026-07-07T15:52:32+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-07T15:52:32+08:00","user":{"id":"6861e48dadc5e31e4da8818d","login":"chenqi317","object_id":"6861e48dadc5e31e4da8818d","name":"chenqi317","avatar_url":"","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/chenqi317"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":178908429,"discussion_id":"3eb453c6ec374347daeb9ad4416199d45e95aee7","body":"compile","created_at":"2026-07-07T15:53:07+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-07T15:53:07+08:00","user":{"id":"6862588a8626502041475f21","login":"gcw_YBIAEfqJ","object_id":"6862588a8626502041475f21","name":"wangweidong","avatar